This is the testing framework for use in Iowa's DUNE DC to DC Converter Box assembly, at least a rough version of it.
All files are required for proper execution, but only MainTesting must be ran to begin testing.

So far, DMM and PS hookups are unit specific.

FetchBoardData will give you a list of all boards and their results on an Excel Sheet, and can also be used to retrieve
the scope trace data of any board. This is all on a scale of ms as of now, with each line 2000 ms total.